the stored transcript, and access to version history and export. | Must | AC-001, AC-019 |
| FR-006 | The author, current participants, and admins can edit a note; others cannot. | Must | AC-004 |
| FR-007 | Saving a note that changed since the editor loaded it is rejected with a conflict warning showing the newer 
version; nothing is overwritten silently. | Must | AC-005 |
| FR-008 | Every successful save creates an immutable version of title, meeting date, participants, content, and 
summary, recording who saved and when. | Must | AC-006 |
