| FR-012 | A member uploads a .txt, .vtt, or .srt transcript of at most 1 MB, either to create a new note or to attach 
to an existing note they can edit; a note holds one transcript and a new upload replaces it. | Must | AC-010 |
| FR-013 | Empty, oversized, wrong-extension, or unreadable (non-text) files are rejected before any AI call with a 
