fields:180](E:/projects/virtual-office/src/types/database.ts:180), [AGENTS schema 
verification:143](E:/projects/virtual-office/AGENTS.md:143).  
    **Fix:** Enumerate required database contracts, legacy-data decisions, date-only representation, grants/RPCs, 
